  "historyNote": "#6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98 New. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
